{
  "name": "@local/usage-trends",
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "description": "用量趋势视图:在会话的「聊天/轨迹」旁新增「趋势」标签页,以 SVG 图表展示逐请求的 Token 流量(计费输入堆叠 + 输出)、累计曲线与请求耗时,并给出会话聚合统计。数据经标准连接层(connection.api.sessions.history)从持久化会话日志读取,重启后自动恢复。客户端插件,Host 半身为空。",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ]
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
